WEBVTT

00:00:01.904 --> 00:00:04.044
Okay, we're doing it for real, now!

00:00:04.044 --> 00:00:04.474
VOICE HAS BEEN CHANGED TO PROTECT PRIVACY

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:06.814
VOICE HAS BEEN CHANGED TO PROTECT PRIVACY
Um... Do I go now?

00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:09.214
VOICE HAS BEEN CHANGED TO PROTECT PRIVACY
Yeah. Tape's rolling.

00:00:09.214 --> 00:00:10.914
VOICE HAS BEEN CHANGED TO PROTECT PRIVACY
Um, well...

00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:17.014
It was our long-awaited hike,
and we all started early in high spirits.

00:00:19.464 --> 00:00:22.294
A hike all day till we go home!

00:00:22.294 --> 00:00:25.494
Hey! The teacher said we couldn't
bring any chocolates to eat!

00:00:25.494 --> 00:00:27.054
Then I'll destroy the evidence.

00:00:28.064 --> 00:00:31.774
Akashi and the other two
were especially excited.

00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:35.294
Um... It was like they'd really
been looking forward to it.

00:00:35.814 --> 00:00:39.104
Hey! No fair! I demand some hush money!

00:00:43.754 --> 00:00:45.384
We never...

00:00:45.384 --> 00:00:48.684
We never expected any of what happened.

00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:59.554
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:00.564 --> 00:01:06.434
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:08.874 --> 00:01:14.674
Meeting you like I did

00:01:15.014 --> 00:01:19.884
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:21.154 --> 00:01:26.684
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:27.094 --> 00:01:31.694
And surely change the future

00:01:32.294 --> 00:01:35.204
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:38.334
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:44.204
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:45.644 --> 00:01:48.214
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:48.214 --> 00:01:51.044
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:51.284 --> 00:01:57.454
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:01:57.594 --> 00:02:00.394
The power given to me

00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:03.034
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:03.034 --> 00:02:08.764
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:09.104 --> 00:02:14.634
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:22.654 --> 00:02:25.774
33rd sense: "Autumn Outing!
The Lunch Box Is In A Grove"

00:02:26.124 --> 00:02:30.054
Yes. It was our first hike.

00:02:30.054 --> 00:02:31.494
And Kaoru...

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:35.854
There was something else Kaoru
was experiencing for the first time!

00:02:36.264 --> 00:02:41.204
When I think back to
Kaoru's face, it breaks my heart.

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:44.164
Where's my lunch box? Isn't it time yet?

00:02:44.274 --> 00:02:45.674
Right, Tono?

00:02:45.674 --> 00:02:49.914
Don't talk about food now. I'm carsick...

00:02:49.914 --> 00:02:51.974
Cut it out!
What?! That's so lame!

00:02:51.974 --> 00:02:53.514
Akashi, stop!

00:02:53.514 --> 00:02:54.284
Ew! Tono!

00:02:54.284 --> 00:02:55.644
Tono!
Ew! Tono!

00:02:55.644 --> 00:02:57.344
Tono puked!

00:03:00.254 --> 00:03:04.744
The lunch Minamoto made for me.
And it's still warm!

00:03:06.324 --> 00:03:08.994
You've been doing that since this morning.

00:03:08.994 --> 00:03:11.364
Don't blame us if you're
disappointed when you open it.

00:03:11.364 --> 00:03:14.824
There's a note on the rice section
that says "Buy side dishes."

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:19.874
Yes. The three of us asked
Mr. Minamoto the night before.

00:03:19.874 --> 00:03:22.104
What we wanted for the hike.

00:03:22.374 --> 00:03:23.414
THE NIGHT BEFORE THE HIKE,
IN A DOWNTOWN CONDO

00:03:23.414 --> 00:03:24.214
THE NIGHT BEFORE THE HIKE,
IN A DOWNTOWN CONDO
Okay, let me see if I've got
everyone's requests straight.

00:03:24.214 --> 00:03:27.484
Okay, let me see if I've got
everyone's requests straight.

00:03:27.484 --> 00:03:30.084
Aoi, you want rice and "colorful side dishes."

00:03:30.084 --> 00:03:33.454
The ones my mom makes are always brown.

00:03:34.054 --> 00:03:36.054
Shiho, you want an "extravagant sandwich".

00:03:36.054 --> 00:03:38.224
No supermarket bread.

00:03:38.224 --> 00:03:40.194
Put some effort into the bread and ingredients.

00:03:40.524 --> 00:03:41.464
And Kaoru...

00:03:41.464 --> 00:03:42.894
Something amazing!

00:03:43.194 --> 00:03:45.834
I want beams to shoot out
of my mouth after one bite,

00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:48.324
and the background to turn into outer space!

00:03:49.474 --> 00:03:52.334
Something traumatic that I'll
remember for my whole life!

00:03:52.944 --> 00:03:54.804
Something traumatic wouldn't be good, right?

00:03:54.804 --> 00:03:56.774
It means to be mentally scarred.

00:03:57.044 --> 00:03:58.514
Anyway, like that!

00:03:58.514 --> 00:03:59.744
As if I could?!

00:04:00.684 --> 00:04:03.614
That would take millennia to pull off!

00:04:03.614 --> 00:04:06.814
Enough. I'll make something normal
and you won't complain!

00:04:08.124 --> 00:04:09.654
I don't want "normal"!

00:04:09.654 --> 00:04:12.694
My mom's an actress, so she's
not good at housewife stuff.

00:04:12.694 --> 00:04:15.754
I've never had a homemade lunch before.

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:19.094
All we ever got was takeout food...

00:04:20.464 --> 00:04:21.694
Kaoru...

00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:26.174
All the more reason I should
make you normal lunches.

00:04:26.174 --> 00:04:27.974
No brown stuff!

00:04:27.974 --> 00:04:30.064
Yeah! Put all your effort into it!

00:04:30.414 --> 00:04:32.244
Unreasonable demands and

00:04:32.244 --> 00:04:36.454
the mental hardship in fulfilling
them is the best spice!

00:04:36.454 --> 00:04:38.854
Filling an empty stomach isn't
like filling a loveless heart...

00:04:38.854 --> 00:04:40.544
Please tell me you're playing around.

00:04:41.624 --> 00:04:45.524
You really do crave peoples'
life blood, don't you?

00:04:46.764 --> 00:04:52.094
13 HOURS LATER

00:04:54.104 --> 00:04:57.074
Minamoto's the guy I see
with you sometimes, right?

00:04:57.074 --> 00:04:58.124
With the glasses?

00:04:58.704 --> 00:04:59.404
Yeah.

00:04:59.404 --> 00:05:01.604
How's he related to you?

00:05:01.604 --> 00:05:04.074
Umm... Our lover?

00:05:04.614 --> 00:05:05.544
We're kidding!

00:05:05.544 --> 00:05:06.944
He's just a relative.

00:05:06.944 --> 00:05:08.534
We're distant relatives.

00:05:09.114 --> 00:05:09.914
But...

00:05:09.914 --> 00:05:12.954
Some day, it's possible we may become a family.

00:05:12.954 --> 00:05:15.424
Although we're still too young for that.

00:05:16.194 --> 00:05:18.814
Serious... They're seriously serious!

00:05:19.424 --> 00:05:22.564
I... I met Mr. Minamoto too, once.

00:05:22.564 --> 00:05:23.464
Really?

00:05:24.794 --> 00:05:27.904
He seemed really cool and nice.

00:05:27.904 --> 00:05:28.634
Yeah!

00:05:28.634 --> 00:05:30.104
And he's smart, too, right?

00:05:30.104 --> 00:05:32.574
He's one of the genius elite!

00:05:33.104 --> 00:05:35.074
He's pretty good at sports, too.

00:05:35.144 --> 00:05:37.114
Hmm... Sounds like...

00:05:37.114 --> 00:05:39.714
the type we wish would just drop dead, huh?

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:43.084
That's great. I wish I had a big brother like that.

00:05:44.854 --> 00:05:45.614
It's bitter.

00:05:46.254 --> 00:05:48.624
You can still drink something
so bitter, big brother?

00:05:48.624 --> 00:05:50.284
Quit it. You're disturbing my work.

00:05:50.754 --> 00:05:52.994
I wish he'd just disappear right now!

00:05:52.994 --> 00:05:55.514
Yeah, if only hating them
made people disappear.

00:05:57.434 --> 00:05:58.994
Darn it, Tono!

00:05:58.994 --> 00:06:00.804
You don't have to throw rocks at me!

00:06:00.804 --> 00:06:02.704
What're you talking about?

00:06:02.704 --> 00:06:04.394
There's no sign that he did that.

00:06:05.374 --> 00:06:07.104
Great. Never mind, then!

00:06:07.104 --> 00:06:08.744
I said it wasn't me.

00:06:08.744 --> 00:06:12.314
Check it out! Minamoto's a pretty good cook.

00:06:12.314 --> 00:06:15.114
I'll share it with you, Chisato.
My lunch box of love!

00:06:15.114 --> 00:06:17.514
Really?! I can't wait!

00:06:18.684 --> 00:06:20.154
That's when the incident...

00:06:20.154 --> 00:06:22.674
And by that, I mean accident, happened.

00:06:23.154 --> 00:06:26.124
I mean, I was just kidding around.

00:06:26.124 --> 00:06:27.824
I didn't mean any harm...

00:06:29.394 --> 00:06:31.124
I'll take that!

00:06:32.134 --> 00:06:33.534
How you like that?

00:06:34.964 --> 00:06:37.364
DON'T!

00:06:48.014 --> 00:06:51.614
You! My!
C-Calm down!

00:06:52.584 --> 00:06:54.954
Should I pop over and get it?

00:06:54.954 --> 00:06:57.424
We can't let anyone see us using our powers.

00:06:57.524 --> 00:06:59.854
And it'd be unnatural if it
just suddenly turned up later.

00:07:00.824 --> 00:07:05.164
And you know Mr. Minamoto.
He probably made more than we can eat.

00:07:05.164 --> 00:07:06.824
If we each give her some of ours, then...

00:07:10.674 --> 00:07:12.974
A... A bagel sandwich?

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:16.174
Do you suppose? Aoi, what do you have?

00:07:18.874 --> 00:07:20.184
W-Well?

00:07:20.184 --> 00:07:22.204
K-Kaoru, we have a problem.

00:07:23.084 --> 00:07:26.284
Mr. Minamoto may have been
saying it was too much trouble,

00:07:26.824 --> 00:07:29.914
but he still made each of us
a lunch like we asked him to.

00:07:31.294 --> 00:07:33.554
I-I-I'll go get it back!

00:07:34.064 --> 00:07:35.064
Akashi!

00:07:35.064 --> 00:07:36.164
She'll be fine!

00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:37.184
But...

00:07:37.934 --> 00:07:39.064
Tono!

00:07:39.064 --> 00:07:41.964
Cover for us with the teacher if we're late!

00:07:42.974 --> 00:07:45.774
She'd be able to use her ESP if she was alone...

00:07:45.774 --> 00:07:48.174
But we'd only raise suspicions
if we tried to stop him.

00:07:49.444 --> 00:07:51.414
Let's wait for them at the summit, Chisato.

00:07:51.414 --> 00:07:52.744
Huh? But...

00:07:52.744 --> 00:07:55.234
It's okay! If Kaoru's with him,

00:07:55.314 --> 00:07:58.114
even if a bear shows up or a cliff
collapses, they'll be fine!

00:07:59.284 --> 00:08:02.254
I thought I'd find my lunch
box immediately, but...

00:08:03.054 --> 00:08:06.324
But when I got there, I couldn't find it anywhere.

00:08:08.124 --> 00:08:12.064
Huh? That's weird. Why can't I find it?

00:08:12.064 --> 00:08:14.904
Look, let's just forget about it and go back.

00:08:14.904 --> 00:08:17.074
You can have some of my lunch.

00:08:17.074 --> 00:08:19.304
No! You go back if you want!

00:08:19.304 --> 00:08:21.144
You know I can't do that.

00:08:21.144 --> 00:08:24.594
Never mind. Just go back!
I'm gonna look a little longer.

00:08:26.514 --> 00:08:29.744
And if anything happened to you,
I'd be traumatized for life.

00:08:30.184 --> 00:08:31.854
And Chisato would probably kill me, too...

00:08:31.854 --> 00:08:33.114
Yeah, probably.

00:08:35.654 --> 00:08:36.884
Uh-oh. Rain!

00:08:36.954 --> 00:08:38.194
TAKAMO SUMMIT

00:08:38.194 --> 00:08:38.894
TAKAMO SUMMIT
Oh, this is bad!

00:08:38.894 --> 00:08:39.194
Oh, this is bad!

00:08:39.194 --> 00:08:40.684
Kaoru...

00:08:41.394 --> 00:08:43.734
I can't teleport in the rain!

00:08:43.734 --> 00:08:46.924
Never mind that. Those two are
all alone and getting soaked!

00:08:51.174 --> 00:08:53.374
It's not coming down as hard as it looks, huh?

00:08:53.374 --> 00:08:55.504
I'm hardly getting wet.

00:08:55.744 --> 00:09:00.014
Because I'm using my psychokinesis
to hold the rain back a little.

00:09:00.014 --> 00:09:04.144
But I'm gonna exhaust myself if I keep this up.

00:09:04.954 --> 00:09:06.474
Boy, I'm hungry...

00:09:14.424 --> 00:09:15.954
What is this place?

00:09:22.904 --> 00:09:27.004
It looks like some sort of facility.
For the reservoir, maybe?

00:09:27.004 --> 00:09:30.564
Electronic locks on the door.
Can't open it with a key, huh?

00:09:31.274 --> 00:09:33.814
And it'd be bad if I blasted
it open in front of Tono.

00:09:33.814 --> 00:09:36.884
The vent grating came loose,
and we fell in through this.

00:09:36.884 --> 00:09:38.984
I don't think we can climb back out.

00:09:38.984 --> 00:09:40.324
What do we do, Akashi?

00:09:40.324 --> 00:09:42.884
Oh, this has all worn me out...

00:09:43.994 --> 00:09:47.084
Whoa! Calm down, Akashi!
I'll share my lunch with you!
I'm so hungry! Minamoto! Mom!

00:09:50.094 --> 00:09:56.224
"Sorry. Overslept. Buy something
from the snack bar. Mom."

00:09:57.074 --> 00:10:00.664
Mom... I feel so cold right now.

00:10:01.074 --> 00:10:03.344
Okay, let's have our lunch here.

00:10:03.344 --> 00:10:07.344
All class reps, take roll and report
your numbers to your teacher.

00:10:07.344 --> 00:10:08.504
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:08.884 --> 00:10:11.454
Darn it! What's taking Hayate so long?

00:10:11.454 --> 00:10:13.324
Where is he and what's he doing?

00:10:13.324 --> 00:10:16.024
Maybe he was attacked by a bear.

00:10:16.024 --> 00:10:18.184
Maybe he fell off a cliff.

00:10:18.794 --> 00:10:21.064
Darn it! And after I took the trouble

00:10:21.064 --> 00:10:24.364
to have Maria's lunches
delivered to the summit here!

00:10:24.994 --> 00:10:26.634
Oh. Hello again, class rep!

00:10:26.634 --> 00:10:28.604
They say the rain should stop soon.

00:10:28.604 --> 00:10:30.074
Thank goodness.

00:10:30.074 --> 00:10:33.174
But should I really have said
that everyone was here?

00:10:33.174 --> 00:10:34.444
It'll be fine.

00:10:34.444 --> 00:10:37.544
If the teacher found out,
Mr. Minamoto would yell at us.

00:10:37.544 --> 00:10:38.314
Right, Shiho?

00:10:38.314 --> 00:10:40.674
Once the rain stops, we'll go look for them.

00:10:41.814 --> 00:10:44.304
I haven't been able to contact
Kaoru for a while now.

00:10:45.054 --> 00:10:47.754
What's wrong? What are you talking about?

00:10:47.754 --> 00:10:48.984
Um... Nothing!

00:10:48.984 --> 00:10:50.584
Excuse us for a sec!

00:10:53.094 --> 00:10:56.964
Now what?! As class rep, I have
responsibilities, you know!

00:10:59.094 --> 00:11:01.434
I'm also an esper!

00:11:02.704 --> 00:11:05.504
There's no way Kaoru and Tono would do that!

00:11:05.504 --> 00:11:08.094
Human relationships aren't set in stone.

00:11:08.674 --> 00:11:11.344
Haven't you noticed a subtle
change in Kaoru lately

00:11:11.344 --> 00:11:13.714
that's hard to put into words?

00:11:14.044 --> 00:11:18.114
Now that you mention it,
she used to be just like me.

00:11:18.114 --> 00:11:20.454
Now it's like we're being
separated from her, bit by bit.

00:11:25.254 --> 00:11:28.494
Meaning, she's matured lately!

00:11:28.494 --> 00:11:30.864
You mean... Her sex appeal is coming out!

00:11:31.234 --> 00:11:31.794
Wh-What? What are they saying?!

00:11:31.794 --> 00:11:33.434
Tono just thinks of Kaoru
as one of the boys, right?
Wh-What? What are they saying?!

00:11:33.434 --> 00:11:35.504
Tono just thinks of Kaoru
as one of the boys, right?

00:11:35.504 --> 00:11:37.404
That's even more dangerous.

00:11:40.274 --> 00:11:43.434
The second he thinks of her as a girl, then!

00:11:46.014 --> 00:11:46.914
What?

00:11:46.914 --> 00:11:48.744
Um, uh... Nothing.

00:11:52.614 --> 00:11:54.624
What are you doing! That's pervy!

00:11:54.624 --> 00:11:57.184
Don't be stupid! Why would I look at you?!

00:11:59.224 --> 00:12:00.564
Are you cold?

00:12:00.564 --> 00:12:03.024
I'm not that cold!

00:12:07.304 --> 00:12:11.964
Don't get any ideas.
I don't have any feelings for you.

00:12:14.004 --> 00:12:16.714
And then Kaoru will realize it, too!

00:12:16.714 --> 00:12:18.914
That she's a girl!

00:12:18.914 --> 00:12:20.114
Impossible!

00:12:20.114 --> 00:12:23.414
I know it's impossible,
so why is it so persuasive?!

00:12:23.484 --> 00:12:25.004
IT CAN'T BE TRUE!

00:12:28.884 --> 00:12:29.874
Oh, so that's it.

00:12:30.224 --> 00:12:32.524
Your mom's a bad cook.

00:12:32.524 --> 00:12:33.664
Pretty much.

00:12:33.664 --> 00:12:36.824
Still, I can't believe this is your first box lunch.

00:12:38.534 --> 00:12:42.334
Besides that, you really love
this Minamoto guy, huh?

00:12:45.974 --> 00:12:51.044
Well... Right now, I can't help enjoying
how he lets me get away with so much.

00:12:51.044 --> 00:12:52.944
Same goes for Shiho and Aoi.

00:12:54.414 --> 00:12:56.604
And what about you?

00:12:56.784 --> 00:12:59.954
You like Chisato a lot, don't you?

00:12:59.954 --> 00:13:01.714
I... Not really, but...

00:13:03.524 --> 00:13:04.854
But, I...

00:13:05.524 --> 00:13:08.594
The truth is, she once scanned
me with her telepathy.

00:13:08.594 --> 00:13:10.624
And I got really mad at her.

00:13:11.764 --> 00:13:14.464
I want to apologize to her for that, someday.

00:13:14.564 --> 00:13:16.294
To say I'm sorry for getting so mad.

00:13:17.674 --> 00:13:19.534
Then you should just apologize already!

00:13:19.904 --> 00:13:21.344
I know she'd be happy if you did.

00:13:21.344 --> 00:13:23.814
I can't do something that embarrassing!

00:13:23.814 --> 00:13:25.714
It's nothing. Just tell her!

00:13:25.714 --> 00:13:27.684
Yeah! Tell her!

00:13:30.554 --> 00:13:32.814
Did you just hear something?

00:13:32.814 --> 00:13:33.644
Yeah.

00:13:35.124 --> 00:13:37.494
Hurry! Dig! They're right under here!

00:13:37.494 --> 00:13:38.294
Underground?

00:13:38.294 --> 00:13:40.854
There's some sort of large building buried here.

00:13:45.964 --> 00:13:46.864
What the?!

00:13:56.204 --> 00:13:58.674
God... Kids these days!

00:13:59.214 --> 00:14:04.084
Even on vacations or sick days,
they never follow my orders!

00:14:04.654 --> 00:14:07.784
National treasures must be protected constantly!

00:14:07.784 --> 00:14:09.444
Hikes are no exception!

00:14:10.894 --> 00:14:11.944
Chief?

00:14:12.324 --> 00:14:15.124
Don't tell us you had this built just for today.

00:14:15.224 --> 00:14:15.624
No! What are you saying?!

00:14:15.624 --> 00:14:16.324
You know him?
No! What are you saying?!

00:14:16.324 --> 00:14:17.064
No!
No! What are you saying?!

00:14:17.064 --> 00:14:19.034
It's just some old guy we don't know at all.
No! What are you saying?!

00:14:19.464 --> 00:14:20.894
My lunch box!

00:14:21.434 --> 00:14:24.134
It was stuck in the elevator gap.

00:14:24.134 --> 00:14:25.674
Which means...

00:14:25.674 --> 00:14:28.234
The chief... I mean, the old
man was the cause of this?

00:14:28.704 --> 00:14:30.194
No! You!

00:14:31.274 --> 00:14:34.714
I don't know! I know nothing about it!

00:14:34.714 --> 00:14:36.044
No comment on anything!

00:14:36.654 --> 00:14:39.284
How can you say that?!
You're the one in charge!

00:14:39.284 --> 00:14:41.424
I don't know means I don't know!

00:14:41.424 --> 00:14:43.944
Please don't tell anyone about this facility.

00:14:46.254 --> 00:14:47.894
Good for you, Kaoru.

00:14:47.894 --> 00:14:50.654
What a disaster. You must be starving.

00:14:52.034 --> 00:14:53.864
Then, let's eat...

00:14:58.204 --> 00:14:59.174
Can bananas be afternoon snacks?

00:14:59.434 --> 00:15:01.204
Akashi's kind of cute.

00:15:01.204 --> 00:15:02.734
I'll kill him.

00:15:03.244 --> 00:15:04.214
Can nuts be afternoon snacks?

00:15:04.444 --> 00:15:06.274
Amazingly! Amazingly!

00:15:10.114 --> 00:15:13.184
I started out intending to just
get out of there at once.

00:15:13.184 --> 00:15:16.014
I never thought it'd all get so out of control...

00:15:16.224 --> 00:15:18.744
PANDRA HIDEOUT - THAT MORNING

00:15:21.224 --> 00:15:23.124
Ew. Wrong flavor.

00:15:23.124 --> 00:15:24.994
Hey, you two!

00:15:25.464 --> 00:15:29.034
It looks like BABEL's built a new secret facility.

00:15:29.034 --> 00:15:31.904
Magi-kins asked me to go check it out.

00:15:31.904 --> 00:15:33.274
Could you help me out?

00:15:33.274 --> 00:15:33.964
Sure.

00:15:35.674 --> 00:15:36.744
Food delivery!

00:15:36.744 --> 00:15:38.904
We have a totally suspicious delivery for you!
You owe us 500 yen!

00:15:39.144 --> 00:15:41.484
D-Dirty thoughts!

00:15:41.484 --> 00:15:43.274
You have a piercing THERE?!

00:15:45.654 --> 00:15:47.124
No point if you can't hit us!

00:15:47.124 --> 00:15:48.584
You suck, lady!

00:15:48.584 --> 00:15:49.284
What?!

00:15:51.654 --> 00:15:53.254
Found you, Chief.

00:15:55.464 --> 00:15:58.294
Strange. I should be invisible wearing this.

00:15:58.734 --> 00:16:00.804
Is this the secret facility?

00:16:00.804 --> 00:16:02.854
But why build it here?

00:16:07.344 --> 00:16:09.704
Is it to just keep an eye on this hike?

00:16:09.704 --> 00:16:12.814
Yeah. That's so like Chief Gorilla to do.

00:16:12.814 --> 00:16:15.784
Hmpf! Look at them, hanging
out with the Normals!

00:16:15.784 --> 00:16:18.974
Why does she have to be our queen?

00:16:20.554 --> 00:16:21.954
Darn it, Tono!

00:16:21.954 --> 00:16:24.054
You don't have to throw rocks at me!

00:16:24.054 --> 00:16:25.884
What're you talking about?

00:16:27.924 --> 00:16:31.394
Check it out! Minamoto's a pretty good cook.

00:16:31.394 --> 00:16:34.234
I'll share it with you, Chisato.
My lunch box of love!

00:16:34.234 --> 00:16:36.334
Really?! I can't wait!

00:16:36.334 --> 00:16:36.974
A lunch box of love?
Really?! I can't wait!

00:16:36.974 --> 00:16:37.834
A lunch box of love?

00:16:38.404 --> 00:16:40.774
Speaking of which, that guy's cooking...

00:16:42.744 --> 00:16:44.764
First come vegetables. Eat your vegetables!

00:16:48.984 --> 00:16:50.254
It has no flavor!

00:16:50.254 --> 00:16:52.354
Your sense of taste is just too dull!

00:16:52.354 --> 00:16:55.324
It's from too many flavor
enhancers and additives!

00:16:55.324 --> 00:16:57.184
Learn what real food tastes like!

00:17:01.264 --> 00:17:05.194
When I think about it, it'd probably
taste better than instant ramen.

00:17:07.004 --> 00:17:08.334
Minamoto's...

00:17:08.334 --> 00:17:09.404
Kaoru's...

00:17:09.404 --> 00:17:10.804
Lunch box...

00:17:11.334 --> 00:17:14.894
No! Stop! Stay away from it!
No need to fear. I'll be gentle with it.

00:17:15.204 --> 00:17:17.314
Look! It's Kaoru's lunch!

00:17:17.314 --> 00:17:18.674
You want it, Mr. Lolicon?!

00:17:18.674 --> 00:17:20.044
I do! Just a bite, Master Momotaro!
You want it, Mr. Lolicon?!

00:17:20.044 --> 00:17:20.874
I do! Just a bite, Master Momotaro!

00:17:23.214 --> 00:17:24.804
I'll take that!

00:17:26.514 --> 00:17:27.224
Momotaro!

00:17:27.224 --> 00:17:28.274
On it!

00:17:30.554 --> 00:17:35.164
I tried as hard as I could,
but I couldn't find that lunch box.

00:17:35.164 --> 00:17:37.594
That's when Kaoru and that kid ran down there.

00:17:38.094 --> 00:17:42.034
Huh? That's weird. Why can't I find it?

00:17:43.774 --> 00:17:46.964
Say, this is right near that
secret base we just found.

00:17:48.904 --> 00:17:50.344
Uh-oh. Rain!

00:17:50.344 --> 00:17:52.474
Get your raincoat on before you get soaked.

00:17:53.914 --> 00:17:57.354
Aw, the kid's kinda nice, don't you think?

00:17:57.354 --> 00:17:59.404
I'd like Kyosuke to see this.

00:18:02.354 --> 00:18:04.324
It's not coming down as hard as it looks, huh?

00:18:04.724 --> 00:18:06.124
I'm hardly getting wet.

00:18:06.124 --> 00:18:10.164
She's gonna wear herself out
using her ESP like that.

00:18:10.164 --> 00:18:11.354
Worried about her?

00:18:12.194 --> 00:18:14.324
Wh-Why would I be?!

00:18:16.004 --> 00:18:17.104
An exhaust vent?

00:18:17.104 --> 00:18:18.634
Kaoru's so clumsy.

00:18:18.634 --> 00:18:19.464
Let's follow them.

00:18:21.774 --> 00:18:23.414
Oh, so that's it.

00:18:23.414 --> 00:18:25.844
Your mom's a bad cook.

00:18:25.844 --> 00:18:26.674
Pretty much.

00:18:29.444 --> 00:18:31.184
Hey! Where are you touching?!

00:18:31.184 --> 00:18:34.714
Well, what are you touching on me,
you gross little kid?!

00:18:35.124 --> 00:18:36.994
Then you should just apologize already!

00:18:36.994 --> 00:18:38.794
I know she'd be happy if you did.

00:18:38.794 --> 00:18:41.194
I can't do something that embarrassing!

00:18:41.194 --> 00:18:42.924
It's nothing. Just tell her!

00:18:43.124 --> 00:18:45.294
Yeah! Tell her!

00:18:46.534 --> 00:18:48.634
Did you just hear something?

00:18:48.634 --> 00:18:50.104
Yeah.

00:18:59.274 --> 00:19:00.914
Good for you, Kaoru.

00:19:00.914 --> 00:19:03.544
What a disaster. You must be starving.

00:19:04.454 --> 00:19:05.154
Mio!

00:19:05.154 --> 00:19:05.874
Got it!

00:19:07.454 --> 00:19:09.284
Then, let's eat...

00:19:12.654 --> 00:19:14.324
I'll take this lunch box!

00:19:14.324 --> 00:19:16.154
Nothing personal!

00:19:16.624 --> 00:19:17.634
My lunch box!

00:19:17.634 --> 00:19:18.394
Mr. Minamoto!

00:19:18.764 --> 00:19:20.964
Special espers The Children!

00:19:21.834 --> 00:19:22.764
Released!

00:19:22.764 --> 00:19:23.364
<<RELEASED>>
Released!

00:19:25.834 --> 00:19:28.834
Lunch box, lunch box, how I adore you!

00:19:29.244 --> 00:19:31.834
The three of us assemble to say hello!

00:19:32.144 --> 00:19:34.804
If you call for us, we'll take the offer!

00:19:35.484 --> 00:19:37.784
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:19:39.884 --> 00:19:41.284
Gimme my lunch back!

00:19:42.284 --> 00:19:43.324
You won't escape!

00:19:43.324 --> 00:19:44.254
Muscle, pass!

00:19:44.524 --> 00:19:47.154
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:19:47.794 --> 00:19:50.354
Wanna see how a shot in the jewels feels?

00:19:50.434 --> 00:19:51.694
No, thanks! Momo, hon!

00:19:51.694 --> 00:19:53.724
MIDAIRFLYING DEVIL SQUIRREL CATCH!

00:19:55.264 --> 00:19:56.864
How do I fly with this?

00:19:58.874 --> 00:20:01.604
That girl was majorly pissed at me.

00:20:01.604 --> 00:20:05.544
But we didn't run! No, sir! We weren't afraid!

00:20:05.544 --> 00:20:09.034
It was a tactical withdrawal!
Our mission was complete.

00:20:14.324 --> 00:20:15.224
Momotaro!

00:20:15.224 --> 00:20:15.884
Yikes!

00:20:16.124 --> 00:20:16.554
Momo, move it!

00:20:16.554 --> 00:20:17.654
I'll remember this! Next time,
I'm gonna kick your sorry butt!
Momo, move it!

00:20:17.654 --> 00:20:20.364
I'll remember this! Next time,
I'm gonna kick your sorry butt!

00:20:20.364 --> 00:20:21.694
See you, Kaoru!

00:20:22.294 --> 00:20:24.994
Didn't she say that last time?

00:20:27.134 --> 00:20:28.964
Now, for real, let's eat!

00:20:29.564 --> 00:20:31.364
Don't be so extravagant.

00:20:36.374 --> 00:20:38.614
I'm really sorry.

00:20:38.614 --> 00:20:40.904
I forgot to put her lunch in her backpack, so...

00:20:41.014 --> 00:20:42.084
It's all right.

00:20:42.084 --> 00:20:44.204
I brought it up to her further down the mountain.

00:20:44.584 --> 00:20:46.514
I'm really sorry for worrying you!

00:20:46.614 --> 00:20:48.144
Thanks, Minamoto.

00:20:52.194 --> 00:20:53.524
That's all. End of report.

00:20:55.164 --> 00:20:57.534
That was tough luck, shrimp.

00:20:57.534 --> 00:20:59.964
You need a lesson in behaving.

00:21:00.664 --> 00:21:02.764
You're restricted to the island till further notice!

00:21:05.074 --> 00:21:06.164
Major, what's?

00:21:07.344 --> 00:21:11.174
You think that idiot Minamoto
can do something that I can't?

00:21:11.644 --> 00:21:13.544
M-Major!

00:21:15.744 --> 00:21:16.584
Well?

00:21:16.584 --> 00:21:20.324
Major... You don't have to be
so competitive at everything.

00:21:20.324 --> 00:21:22.084
It's not very mature.

00:21:22.454 --> 00:21:23.324
Shut up!

00:21:23.324 --> 00:21:24.224
Let's eat!

00:21:24.294 --> 00:21:26.494
Hey! No fair, hogging it for yourself!

00:21:26.494 --> 00:21:27.494
Delicious!

00:21:27.494 --> 00:21:28.684
Oh, you think so?
Gimme a bite!

00:21:28.924 --> 00:21:30.124
Hey! That's mine!

00:21:30.124 --> 00:21:30.934
Like I said, immature.
Hey! That's mine!

00:21:30.934 --> 00:21:31.764
Like I said, immature.

00:21:31.764 --> 00:21:33.464
Who's immature?!

00:21:33.464 --> 00:21:34.934
Magi said it!

00:21:35.004 --> 00:21:35.834
Like hell I did!

00:21:35.834 --> 00:21:37.334
They're all pretty much idiots.

00:21:37.334 --> 00:21:39.334
You're one to talk!

00:21:39.334 --> 00:21:41.234
What was that?!

00:21:45.274 --> 00:21:47.764
Um... Did I do anything wrong in this episode?

00:21:47.884 --> 00:21:49.544
No, but, well...

00:21:51.484 --> 00:21:51.884
Okay, people! Great job!

00:21:51.884 --> 00:21:53.974
Huh? Wait! What's going on?!
Okay, people! Great job!

00:21:54.624 --> 00:21:56.484
Hey! Everyone!

00:21:58.724 --> 00:22:00.784
Like I said, immature.

00:22:02.524 --> 00:22:06.134
It's okay, Mr. Minamoto.
Good things will come to you, someday.

00:22:06.134 --> 00:22:08.894
Um, My Lady? Where are you?

00:22:21.314 --> 00:22:26.054
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:26.054 --> 00:22:29.024
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:29.024 --> 00:22:31.394
I love

00:22:31.394 --> 00:22:35.564
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:35.564 --> 00:22:41.464
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:41.734 --> 00:22:46.774
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:46.774 --> 00:22:50.274
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:22:50.274 --> 00:22:53.414
I absolutely will never let you go

00:22:53.414 --> 00:22:55.584
No matter when or why

00:22:55.584 --> 00:23:00.754
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:00.754 --> 00:23:05.094
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:05.094 --> 00:23:10.734
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:10.734 --> 00:23:15.434
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:15.434 --> 00:23:18.004
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:18.004 --> 00:23:21.804
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:21.804 --> 00:23:24.744
Together, you and I

00:23:24.974 --> 00:23:30.604
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.924 --> 00:23:41.064
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.064 --> 00:23:41.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.894 --> 00:23:43.194
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.194 --> 00:23:45.064
Foolish humans!

00:23:45.064 --> 00:23:46.794
Your age is over!

00:23:46.794 --> 00:23:49.504
Now comes the age of us houseflies!

00:23:49.504 --> 00:23:51.074
Shiho's been possessed by flies!

00:23:51.074 --> 00:23:53.234
But isn't that just like her true self?

00:23:53.234 --> 00:23:54.304
I want to eat poop.

00:23:54.304 --> 00:23:54.974
Minamoto?!

00:23:54.974 --> 00:23:55.604
No!

00:23:55.604 --> 00:23:56.744
Stop!

00:23:56.744 --> 00:23:58.314
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.314 --> 00:24:02.304
Episode 34. "Overrun With Pests!
Minamoto Uses His Hands and Feet?!"

00:24:02.714 --> 00:24:05.354
It looks so yummy! I want to eat it all!

00:24:05.354 --> 00:24:06.614
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.614 --> 00:24:07.454
Overrun With Pests!
Minamoto Uses His Hands and Feet!?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:07.454 --> 00:24:09.884
Overrun With Pests!
Minamoto Uses His Hands and Feet!?
